# Everything under $DSH_HOME is runtime-generated by dsh on first use
# (profiles/<name>/, .credentials.yaml, session data, …).
# Track the config we author here:
#   - cordis.patch.yml   (this repo's home-level patch, read on every boot)
#   - settings.yaml      (model providers & defaults, mirrored from the pi seed)
# Settings is still dsh-managed: the Web UI may rewrite it, so expect the odd
# noise diff in git status; .credentials.yaml (secrets) stays ignored.
# Un-ignore any other file you want to ship/version.
*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitkeep
!/cordis.patch.yml
!/settings.yaml